# kernelbase: Implement GetSecurityDescriptorRMControl and SetSecurityDescriptorRMControl.
# https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/12650 state=closed
# This series implements the Resource Manager Control security descriptor APIs:

1. ntdll: Implement RtlGetSecurityDescriptorRMControl and RtlSetSecurityDescriptorRMControl.
2. kernelbase: Implement GetSecurityDescriptorRMControl and SetSecurityDescriptorRMControl, forwarding from advapi32.

Also adds accompanying unit tests in the advapi32 security winetest suite.
